{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415345","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415345","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041534501:1":{"text":"……又到了这个季节。","source_cn":"……又到了这个季节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854E6261780900EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534502:1":{"text":"寒冷，黑暗，连转瞬即逝的冰雪都足以化为永恒。","source_cn":"寒冷，黑暗，连转瞬即逝的冰雪都足以化为永恒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9E0F13300FE329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534503:1":{"text":"这是属于我等亡灵的日子……不是吗？","source_cn":"这是属于我等亡灵的日子……不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999BC04A95486721","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534504:1":{"text":"正是如此，陛下，这漫长与宁静的安详之死，唯有此时此刻才能享受。","source_cn":"正是如此，陛下，这漫长与宁静的安详之死，唯有此时此刻才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB42A3F05A22B70FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534505:1":{"text":"说到这个，你的那些小宝贝们，不会冬眠吧？","source_cn":"说到这个，你的那些小宝贝们，不会冬眠吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED551D67CFCD36A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041